{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracker built with samplers runs them on its worker, after its enrichers, so a sampler sees","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"what they set:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let tracker = Tracker(samplers: [","    .events(of: Scrolled.self, rate: 0.1),","    .events(where: { $0.consentCategory == .performance }, rate: 0.5),","])"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each sampler decides on its own, and a record is kept only if every sampler that applies to it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps it. A kept record carries the product of their rates as its "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRateKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"; one no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sampler applies to is always kept and carries no key. Each dropped record is reported on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The decisions come from the tracker’s sampling seed, the same on every platform and Swift","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"release: with a seed fixed, which events are kept is fixed too. Each sampler draws from a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream of its own, picked by its place in the tracker’s list: appending a sampler changes no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other’s decisions, but inserting, removing or reordering one gives every sampler after it a new","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream, so it decides differently under the same seed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Sampler.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Sampler.swift#L28"},"role":"symbol","title":"Sampler","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"topicSections":[{"title":"Type Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(of:rate:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(where:rate:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/grouped(by:where:rate:)"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Sampler":{"kind":"symbol","title":"Sampler","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler","abstract":[{"text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers":{"role":"collection","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","type":"topic","title":"Trackers","url":"\/documentation\/trackers"},"doc://Trackers/s8SendableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/SampleRateKey":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"ServiceContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" key of the rate a record was kept at, which a tracker’s ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"s set on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the context of every record they keep.","type":"text"}],"title":"SampleRateKey","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRateKey","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SampleRateKey","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/sampleratekey","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SampleRateKey","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/samplingDropReports":{"kind":"symbol","title":"samplingDropReports","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/samplingdropreports","abstract":[{"text":"A report of each event the tracker’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentat